    "body": "Currently, on my personal computer, awaiting a promise will let the JS engine to parse about 4 ms even the promise simply return null as a constant value. If a web game wants to reach 60FPS, the time for each frame is.only 16.6ms. 4ms will cause a 25% performance problem and this is inacceptable.",
